# Additional apt sources (*.list or deb822 *.sources) picked up by fai-mirror
# and fai-make-nfsroot. This comments-only file keeps the directory in git and
# its name is deliberate: apt notices files without a known extension, the
# fai-mirror backports detection globs sources.list.d/* so the file must not
# be hidden, and its *.list rewrite loop breaks on absolute paths.
